      "solutionReview": {
        "headline": "Even roots return the nonnegative magnitude of an unrestricted squared quantity.",
        "reasoning": [
          "The coefficient contributes {{k}}.",
          "Without x≥0, $\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$, not x.",
          "$y^2$ is already nonnegative, so $\\sqrt{y^4}=y^2$. The correct rewrite is ${{k}}|x|y^2$."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "${{k}}|x|y^2$"
